# Code owners for this repo.
#
# GitHub auto-requests a review from the listed owner(s) on any PR touching
# a matched path, and (if "Require review from Code Owners" is turned on
# under branch protection) blocks merging without it. One rule, one owner,
# covering the whole tree — this is a single-maintainer project, so the
# point isn't distributing review load, it's making sure nothing merges
# into infrastructure-as-code (Terraform state, IAM policy, cluster config)
# without the owner explicitly looking at the diff first.
#
# See https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

